name=GoM Extension: Guns of Tien - Post-93
id=GoMExtensionGunsOfTienPost93
description=Optional add-on for GoM Extension: Guns of Tien with twenty-four guns from after July 1993: the H&K MP7 and the FN P90 TR (both held like a pistol; the main mod has the original P90 with its ring sight), the FN PS90 Carbine (the P90 with a 16-inch barrel and an M-LOK handguard, held like a rifle), the FN Five-seveN pistol, the H&K UCP Prototype pistol, the FN SCAR-L and SCAR-H rifles, the H&K UMP45 and UMP9 submachine guns, the Steyr AUG A3, AUG Para and AUG HBAR the KRISS Vector .45 and 9mm submachine guns (the 9mm held like a pistol) and the KRISS Vector .45 Carbine (the Vector CRB Enhanced: an M-LOK handguard, a 16-inch barrel in a long shroud, an M4-type stock) and the KRISS Vector 9mm Pistol (the Vector SDP, no stock, held like a pistol), the Desert Tech MDRx .223 and .308 semi-automatic bullpup rifles, the H&K HK416 rifle (its iron sights fold under an optic), the Mk 11 Mod 0 sniper rifle (the SR-25 with rails all round) and the OTs-14 Groza-1 (7.62x39mm; also with a GP-25 grenade launcher), Groza-2 Prototype (5.45x39mm) and Groza-4 (9x39mm) bullpups, with their magazines (MP7 20, 30, 40 and a 60-round drum; P90 50; Five-seveN 20 and 30; UCP 20 and a 40-round drum; SCAR-H 20, 10 and a 50-round drum, the SCAR-L takes Guns of Marz's STANAG magazines; UMP45 25, 20 and 10; UMP9 30; AUG Para 25 and 32; AUG HBAR 30 and 50, the AUG A3 takes the AUG A1's; the Vectors take Glock magazines, the .45s the Glock 21's 13 and a 30, the 9mms Guns of Marz's Glock 17 17, a 33 and a 40; the MDRx .308 Magpul's 10, 20 and 25-round PMAGs and a 50-round D-50 drum, the MDRx .223 and the HK416 take Guns of Marz's STANAG magazines; the Mk 11 and MDRx .308 also take the SR-25's 20; the Grozas take Guns of Marz's AK-47, AK-74 and AS VAL magazines, the Groza-1 the RPK's too), suppressors, and 4.6x30mm and 5.7x28mm ammunition, which can also be made with Ammo Maker (optional). Enable it together with GoM Extension: Guns of Tien.
